{"game":"Raft","source":"core","apworld":null,"world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99}},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full"},{"key":"minimum_resource_pack_amount","name":"Minimum resource pack amount","kind":"range","doc":"The minimum amount of resources available in a resource pack","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":15,"default":1},{"key":"maximum_resource_pack_amount","name":"Maximum resource pack amount","kind":"range","doc":"The maximum amount of resources available in a resource pack","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":15,"default":5},{"key":"duplicate_items","name":"Duplicate items","kind":"choice","doc":"Adds duplicates of items to the item pool (if configured in Filler items). These will be selected alongside\nResource Packs (if configured). Note that there are not many progression items, and selecting Progression may\nproduce many of the same duplicate item.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"progression","label":"Progression","id":0},{"value":"non_progression","label":"Non Progression","id":1},{"value":"any","label":"Any","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"any"},{"key":"filler_item_types","name":"Filler items","kind":"choice","doc":"Determines whether to use Resource Packs, Duplicate Items (as configured), or both.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"resource_packs","label":"Resource Packs","id":0},{"value":"duplicates","label":"Duplicates","id":1},{"value":"both","label":"Both","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"resource_packs"},{"key":"island_frequency_locations","name":"Frequency locations","kind":"choice","doc":"Sets where frequencies for story islands are located.\nVanilla will keep frequencies in their vanilla, non-randomized locations.\nRandom On Island will randomize each frequency within its vanilla island, but will preserve island order.\nRandom Island Order will change the order you visit islands, but will preserve the vanilla location of each frequency unlock.\nRandom On Island Random Order will randomize the location containing the frequency on each island and randomize the order.\nProgressive will randomize the frequencies to anywhere, but will always unlock the frequencies in vanilla order as the frequency items are received.\nAnywhere will randomize the frequencies to anywhere, and frequencies will be received in any order.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"random_on_island","label":"Random On Island","id":1},{"value":"random_island_order","label":"Random Island Order","id":2},{"value":"random_on_island_random_order","label":"Random On Island Random Order","id":3},{"value":"progressive","label":"Progressive","id":4},{"value":"anywhere","label":"Anywhere","id":5}],"aliases":{},"default":"random_island_order"},{"key":"island_generation_distance","name":"Island distance","kind":"choice","doc":"Sets how far away islands spawn from you when you input their coordinates into the Receiver.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"quarter","label":"Quarter","id":2},{"value":"half","label":"Half","id":4},{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":8},{"value":"double","label":"Double","id":16},{"value":"quadrouple","label":"Quadrouple","id":32}],"aliases":{},"default":"vanilla"},{"key":"expensive_research","name":"Expensive research","kind":"toggle","doc":"If No is selected, researching items and unlocking items in the Crafting Table works the same as vanilla Raft.\nIf Yes is selected, each unlock in the Crafting Table will require its own set of researched items in order to unlock it.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"progressive_items","name":"Progressive items","kind":"toggle","doc":"Makes some items, like the Bow and Arrow, progressive rather than raw unlocks.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"big_island_early_crafting","name":"Early recipes behind big islands","kind":"toggle","doc":"Allows recipes that require items from big islands (eg leather) to lock earlygame items like the Receiver, Bolt,\nor Smelter. Big islands are available from the start of the game, however it can take a long time to find them.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"paddleboard_mode","name":"Paddleboard Mode","kind":"toggle","doc":"Sets later story islands to be in logic without an Engine or Steering Wheel. May require lots of paddling.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n","default":"false"}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an important item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"priority_locations","name":"Priority Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"item_links","name":"Item Links","kind":"plando","doc":"Share part of your item pool with other players.","weighted":false,"visibility":13,"doc_html":"<p>Share part of your item pool with other players.</p>\n","default":[]},{"key":"plando_items","name":"Plando Items","kind":"plando","doc":"Generic items plando.","weighted":false,"visibility":9,"default":[]}]}],"extra_keys":[],"items":["Advanced Battery","Advanced Scarecrow","Advanced biofuel refiner","Advanced collection net","Advanced grill","Advanced head light","Advanced large crop plot","Advanced medium crop plot","Advanced purifier","Advanced small crop plot","Advanced stationary anchor","Antenna","Backpack","Balboa Island Frequency","Basic bow","Battery","Battery charger","Beehive","Big backpack","Binoculars","Biofuel refiner","Birds nest","Bolt","Bucket","Caravan Island Frequency","Circuit board","Clay bowl","Cookingpot","Drinking glass","Electric Smelter","Electric grill","Electric purifier","Electric zipline tool","Empty bottle","Empty canteen","Engine","Engine controls","Firework","Flippers","Fuel pipe","Fuel tank","Good healing salve","Grass plot","Hammock","Head light","Healing salve","Hinge","Honey","Juicer","Large Storage","Large crop plot","Leather body armor","Leather greaves","Leather helmet","Machete","Medium crop plot","Metal arrow","Metal axe","Metal detector","Metal fishing rod","Metal spear","Net canister","Net launcher","Oxygen bottle","Receiver","Recycler","Resourc